  "description": "Who says cats can’t be little troublemakers? In Bad Cat Angry Granny, you’re not just any pet—you’re the ultimate feline prankster with a mission: turn Granny’s peaceful home into your personal playground of chaos.\n\nScratch the furniture, knock over priceless vases, sneak snacks from the kitchen, and turn every cozy corner into a disaster zone. Each room is packed with toys, secrets, and breakable goodies just begging for your claws. But watch out—Granny’s on the lookout, and she’s not exactly patient with furry troublemakers.\n\nChoose your cat’s look, from cute and cuddly to wild and wacky, then pounce your way through hilarious challenges and clever pranks. Outsmart Granny, push her buttons, and rack up points for every bit of mischief you pull off.\n\nFrom the attic to the basement, every space is your stage for chaos. So sharpen those claws, flick your tail, and remember—life’s too short to be a “good kitty.”",
